  "title": "pr-lens workflow: provider fallback, temperature control, and lens retry",
  "summary": "The pr-lens GitHub Actions workflow gains three behaviours. Provider rows now carry a temperature column, so OpenAI reasoning models can be asked for no fixed temperature while DeepSeek and Anthropic keep 0. OpenAI is only attempted when a model is configured (PR_LENS_OPENAI_MODEL or PR_LENS_MODEL), and a key-without-model skip is recorded and surfaced in the failure note. Each provider attempt now tries both lenses first and, on failure, retries with the architecture lens alone before falling through to the second provider. The CLI version is bumped to 0.13.0.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
